  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 80d4a82738040c14881156c7c1fbf810, type: 3}
  m_Name: RecipeArtCatalog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TheTrailWalker.Tier1RecipeArtCatalog
  Revision: 1
  UnlockPolicy: Require recipe acquisition AND discovered exact ingredient sources
    AND known intermediate conversions or accessible exact-item shops. Recursively
    check upstream sources; no future-tier pantry bypass. Never offer unassigned
    sources. Optional box/bakery recipes cannot block mandatory missions.
  ArtPolicy: Catalog is authoring data only. No auto-learning, crafting transaction,
    shop stock or region spawn changes. Serving vessels are illustrative unless explicitly
    listed as an ingredient. Recipes are knowledge, not inventory scroll stacks.
    CraftingPathSourceIds/ConversionRecipeIds describe the self-crafted supply path;
    an explicitly reachable exact-output shop may provide an alternate path, never
    a recipe grant. Source records for the same ID are alternatives; Regions lists
    are any eligible source region, not all regions required.
